                    "@value": "The stylish ambience of the fireplace room can accommodate more than 50 people. At around 85 m², it forms the heart of the level. It is complemented by a cozy bar for breaks and a flexibly usable adjoining room that can be partitioned off if required. Direct access to the castle park rounds off the ambience of the fireplace hall level."
